# Tiny Crimson Whelpling from the red whelps of the eastern Wetlands.
# Sources: items.json (Red Whelp 0.16%, Crimson Whelp 0.14%, Flamesnorting
# Whelp 0.06% per kill, Classic drop data; their spawns); the world database
# (about 50 whelps, five-minute respawn, Classic data); Forever's client
# data (the whelpling does not bind, so it can be traded).

step Wetlands whelps
  tip The red whelps live in the hills of the eastern Wetlands, towards Grim Batol: about 50 of them, back about five minutes after a kill in Classic's data. Red Whelps (levels 23-24) and Crimson Whelps (25-26) drop the whelpling about once in 650 kills, the Flamesnorting Whelps (26-27) mixed in with them only once in 1,600, so expect a long farm. It can be traded, so the Auction House may be quicker.
  collect 8499 @64.6,42.2              -- Wetlands whelps
